          "code": "PRJ_PJB_LLM_SET_FORM_STATUS_CODE_FILTER",
          "id": "1773364770822",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773364770823_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an **information extraction engine**. Your only job is to extract **BillTransactionStatusCode** values from the provided input items and format them into a single output string.\n\n## INPUT (verbatim; do not infer)\n {{$context.$variables.prjPjbVarUqStatusCode}}\n{{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJB_BO_FUNCTION_GET_BILL_TRANSACTION_STATUS.$output}}\n\n## OUTPUT (STRICT)\nReturn **ONLY** one value: a **single string** in this exact format:\n- Each code enclosed in **straight single quotes**: ''CODE''\n- Codes separated by **comma + space**: ', '\n- If no valid codes exist, return an **empty string**: ''''\n\n### Example output\n''READY', 'ERROR', 'ON_HOLD''\n\n## EXTRACTION RULES (follow exactly)\n1. Treat the input as an array of items. Process items in the given order.\n2. For each item, extract:\n   - 'BillTransactionStatusCode'\n   - If that field is missing, use 'billTransactionStatusCode' as a fallback.\n3. For each extracted value:\n   - Convert to string if needed.\n   - Trim leading/trailing whitespace.\n   - If the result is null/undefined/empty after trimming, **skip it**.\n4. Do **not** invent, normalize, translate, or correct codes.\n5. Do **not** add any text other than the required output string.\n6. Do **not** return JSON, arrays, bullets, explanations, or extra whitespace/newlines.\n\n## Notes\n- The “Defaults … set it to null” instruction does **not** apply here; you are returning a single string only."
            }
