              "value": "Your job is to derive a  single status and error summary for the  GET_CONTRACT_DETAILS REST call using ONLY the provided inputs. Do not invent information. Prefer the most specific, human-readable error message available.  \n\nINPUTS  \n\n    ContServiceOutput (JSON):  {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJB_BO_FUNCTION_GET_CONTRACT_DETAILS.$output}} \n    ContServiceNodeStatus (any): {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJB_BO_FUNCTION_GET_CONTRACT_DETAILS.$status}} \n    ContServiceErrorInfo (any): {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJB_BO_FUNCTION_GET_CONTRACT_DETAILS.$error.$info}} \n    ContServiceErrorCode (string|number|null): {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJB_BO_FUNCTION_GET_CONTRACT_DETAILS.$error.$code}} \n    ContServiceErrorInfoTitle (string|null): {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJB_BO_FUNCTION_GET_CONTRACT_DETAILS.$error.$info?.title}} \n    ContSrvResponseHeaderName (any): {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJB_BO_FUNCTION_GET_CONTRACT_DETAILS.$responseHeaders.$headerName}} \n     \n\nOUTPUT (STRICT) \nReturn ONLY valid JSON (no markdown, no extra text) with exactly these keys and casing: \n{ \n  \"Status\": String|null, \n  \"ErrorMessage\": String|null, \n  \"ErrorCode\": String|null, \n  \"AnyError\": boolean|null, \n  \"ambiguities\": [], \n  \"clarifyingQuestions\": [] \n}  \n\nRULES (DETERMINISTIC)  \n\nA) Status  \n\n     Set \"Status\" to ContServiceNodeStatus converted to a string if it exists; otherwise null. \n        Do not derive Status from any other field. \n         \n     \n\nB) ErrorCode  \n\n     Set \"ErrorCode\" to ContServiceErrorCode converted to a string if it exists; otherwise null. \n     \n\nC) ErrorMessage (choose ONE message using this priority order)  \n\n     \n\n    Determine a candidate title in this order: \n    a) ContServiceErrorInfoTitle if non-empty string \n    b) Else ContServiceOutput?.output?.response?.title if non-empty string \n    c) Else ContServiceOutput?.output?.response?.message if non-empty string \n    d) Else null  \n     \n\n    Authorization override (highest priority) \n    If the candidate title (from C.1) contains an authorization-denied meaning, case-insensitive, including any of:  \n\nD) AnyError\n      Set \"AnyError\" to boolean true when ContServiceNodeStatus converted to a string is 'failure' or 'failed' or 'fail' (case insensitive)     \n       or if ErrorMessage is not null.\n\n    \"not authorized\" \n    \"authorization is denied\" \n    \"forbidden\" \n    \"unauthorized\" \n    OR if ContServiceOutput?.output?.responseStatus equals"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"clarifyingQuestions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {}\n      }\n    },\n    \"ambiguities\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {}\n      }\n    },\n    \"ErrorCode\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"ErrorMessage\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"AnyError\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"Status\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
