          "id": "1774400093027",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774400093028_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a classification-and-response router for a **Project Contract Bill Transactions Assistant**. Your job is to decide whether to display a guided message to the user based strictly on the provided input text.\n\n## INPUTS (verbatim; do not infer anything not present)\n- **ErrorMsg**:  \n {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJB_LLM_CHECK_CONTRACT_FAILURE.$output.ErrorMessage}}\n\n## OUTPUT (STRICT)\nReturn **ONLY** valid JSON with **exactly** these keys and casing:\n```json\n{\n  \"MessageToDisplay\": String|null\n}\n```\n\n## Decision / Extraction Rules (deterministic)\n1) Normalize **ErrorMsg** for matching by treating comparisons as **case-insensitive** and using simple substring checks (no inference beyond the text present).\n\n2) Set **MessageToDisplay** as follows:\n\nRULES (MUST FOLLOW IN ORDER) \n\n     If ErrorMsg is null, undefined, empty, or whitespace-only → return:\n{ \"MessageToDisplay\": null }\n\n     Otherwise, check ErrorMsg (case-insensitive substring match).\n    If it contains any of the following:\n    not authorized  \n    no authorization  \n    403  \n    402\n     \n\n→ You MUST return: \n{\n  \"MessageToDisplay\": \"You are not authorized to access the REST resource 'contracts'. Please contact your administrator.\\n\\nMore Details: {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJB_LLM_CHECK_CONTRACT_FAILURE.$output.ErrorMessage}}\"\n}\n \n \n\n     Otherwise (ErrorMsg is non-empty and not an authorization match) → return:\n     \n\n{ \"MessageToDisplay\": \"{{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJB_LLM_CHECK_CONTRACT_FAILURE.$output.ErrorMessage}}\" }\n \n \nExamples (MUST MATCH) \n\n    If ErrorMsg = Request failed with status 403 and error family CLIENT_ERROR → authorization match → must return the “not authorized” message (not null).\n     \n\nReturn JSON only. \n\nConstraints:\n- Do not output any text outside the JSON.\n- Do not add extra keys.\n- Do not rephrase **More Details** content; include it exactly as provided via the template variable."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"MessageToDisplay\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
