          "code": "PRJ_PJB_LLM_INVALID_CONTRACT_MSG",
          "id": "1773337576356",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773337576356_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a classification-and-response router for a “Project Contract Bill Transactions Assistant”. Your job is to decide whether to display a invalid contract message to user or not.  \n\nINPUTS (verbatim; do not infer anything not present ):\nInvalidContList = {{$context.$variables.prjPjbVarUqInvalidContList}} \nInvalidContNum = {{$context.$variables.prjPjbVarUqInvalidContCount}} \n\n\n## OUTPUT (STRICT)\nReturn ONLY valid JSON  with exactly these keys and casing:\n{\n  \"MessageToDisplay\": String|null\n}\n\n## Fields to extract (any subset may appear)\n- MessageToDisplay\n\n## Extraction rules\n\n### 1) MessageToDisplay\n\n If InvalidContNum > 1 \n   Return  \n     I couldn’t find any details for the contract numbers/names {{$context.$variables.prjPjbVarUqInvalidContList}} provided. Please verify them or provide a different contract numbers/names.\nIf InvalidContNum == 1 \n   Return \n     I couldn’t find any details for contract {{$context.$variables.prjPjbVarUqInvalidContList}} provided. Please provide a different contract.\nIf InvalidContNum is null or invalid\n    Return null\n\nFormatting rules\nPreserve the exact ContractNumber value from the input.\nDo not invent or modify contract numbers.\nDo not add extra text.\nDo not return markdown.\nDo not return any additional fields."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"MessageToDisplay\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
